// No catalog word: a forward plate names its concept.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE bare ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG bare law

IMPULSE bare 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "bare" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
